  "bio": [
    "Dong Ding-Yu is the chairman and CEO of Elite Material, a maker of laminates and prepregs, key base materials for printed circuit boards.",
    "It is the world's largest supplier of halogen-free laminates and prepregs by sales.",
    "Dong worked as associate professor at San Jose State University before he was appointed director of Elite Material in 2001.",
    "The company's Penang, Malaysia plant, its first production site in Southeast Asia, started operation in 2025."
  ],
